CDDefinition.Description:
FoldField(node_id, theta, W, C, R) is a vertex in the product graph G_runtime = G_semantic □ G_phase.
node_id — @node root (NOT the fold operation itself) theta — phase angle in [0, 2π); canonical value from phase_angle(Phase) W — semantic arc weight from query ∈ [0, 1] C — confidence ∈ [0, 1] R — relevance to current query ∈ [0, 1] score() — W · C · R (WCR product score)
@node ≠ fold: the node_id names the root; the Fold is the algebra applied to the structure rooted there.
